kalifrnia (be anglisi: California) ialti dr ghrb amrika br kraneye aqianvs aram ast. mrkz an sakramntv v shhrhai mhm an lsanjls, sn digv, sn khvze v sanfransiskv hstnd.hmchnin in ialt pr jmit trin ialt amrika ast.
nam in ialt az zban aspanivli v be khsvs az rmani be nam Las sergas de Esplandian grfte shde, v mtalq be shkhsiti az in dastan ast be nam mlke Califia ke ahtmalan az vajeye arbi «khlife» grfte shde.[2]
kalifrnia prjmittrin ialt ialat mthde amrikast v niz bzrgtrin jmit irani tbar kharj az khavr miane ra dr khvd jai dade ast[3] be tvri ke chndin tn az aazai shvrai shhr bvrli hilz iranialasl hstnd.
kalifrnia nhmin aqtsad jhan ast. dr sal 2012, in ialt tvlid nakhals dakhli brabr ba 1,958,904trilivn dlar dasht, ke nzdik be tvlid nakhals dakhli kshvr italia (2,013,375 milivn dlar) bvd.[4]
kalifrnia snat fnavri atlaat v raianei bsiar pishrftei dard be tvri ke shrkthai avrakl, siskv sistmz, intl, gvgl, iahv, shrkt iamdi, san maikrvsistmz, v niz shrkt raianei apl v shivran niz dr in ialt mrkzit darnd.
alave br in, dv add az azmaishgaehai fdral bzrg amrika dr in ialt qrar darnd az jmle azmaishgae mli larns livrmvr v azmaishgae mli larns brkli.
